description:
Inject episodic memory context (MemPalace search results) into the bead creation prompt during the planning phase, alongside the existing CASS context injection.

## Background

In src/tools/approve.ts, around line 400, there is already a CASS context injection:

  // Auto-inject CASS context into bead creation prompt
  try {
    const { withCassContext } = await import('../feedback.js');
    creationPrompt = withCassContext(creationPrompt, ctx.cwd, 'creating beads for: ' + oc.state.selectedGoal);
  } catch { /* best-effort */ }

We add a parallel episodic memory injection immediately after this block. The planner gets verbatim examples of how similar projects were structured into beads in previous orchestration runs — much richer than CASS rules alone.

## What to change

Find the block around line 398-409 in src/tools/approve.ts. After the existing CASS withCassContext block, add:

  // Auto-inject episodic context (MemPalace) into bead creation prompt
  try {
    const { getEpisodicContext, detectMempalace } = await import('../episodic-memory.js');
    if (detectMempalace()) {
      const projectSlug = path.basename(ctx.cwd).replace(/[^a-zA-Z0-9]/g, '-');
      const episodicCtx = getEpisodicContext(oc.state.selectedGoal ?? '', projectSlug);
      if (episodicCtx) {
        creationPrompt = creationPrompt + '\n\n' + episodicCtx;
      }
    }
  } catch { /* best-effort */ }

## Notes

- The oc.state.selectedGoal is the user's chosen goal string — use it as the search query
- projectSlug: path.basename(ctx.cwd).replace(/[^a-zA-Z0-9]/g, '-')
- Make sure path is imported (check existing imports at top of file)
- The episodic context is appended to creationPrompt (the bead-planning LLM prompt), not returned to the user
- If mempalace not installed or no results, creationPrompt is unchanged

## Acceptance criteria
- [ ] Episodic context injection block added after the CASS withCassContext block (~line 405)
- [ ] Uses dynamic import('../episodic-memory.js') — not static top-level import
- [ ] detectMempalace() checked before calling getEpisodicContext (avoid slow CLI when not installed)
- [ ] projectSlug derived as path.basename(ctx.cwd).replace(/[^a-zA-Z0-9]/g, '-')
- [ ] selectedGoal passed as the search query to getEpisodicContext
- [ ] Entire block in try/catch — no error propagates
- [ ] creationPrompt unchanged if mempalace not available or no results found
- [ ] npm run build passes with zero type errors
- [ ] npm test passes (existing tests unbroken)

